The function `wxPlatformInfo::InitForCurrentPlatform()` initializes a `wxPlatformInfo` object with information about the current platform. It retrieves information such as the operating system, toolkit version, and CPU architecture. The function does not take any arguments but relies on the global `wxApp` object being initialized. If the `wxApp` object is not initialized, the function will fail.
